# TypeOK pairing: a value lands that is not a stored value at all.
MODULE: TypeOKPutUndeclaredValue
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a landing writes a torn value outside the value domain
PERTURBS: Put

--- FIND
    /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![k] = v]
--- REPLACE
    /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![k] = Val("Torn", 0, 0, 0, TRUE)]
--- END